@startuml
[*] --> pending : User selects plan and checkout starts

pending --> active : Checkout succeeds & Payment verified
pending --> [*] : Timeout / Cancelled by user

active --> cancelled : Auto-renew disabled / cancelled
active --> expired : Subscription window lapses without payment
active --> in_grace_period : Payment fails, in billing retry cycle

in_grace_period --> active : Payment succeeds during grace period
in_grace_period --> expired : Grace period ends without payment

cancelled --> expired : Expiry date reached

expired --> active : User purchases new subscription / renews
expired --> [*] : Account deletion
@enduml
